## What Was Reviewed

### Flow 5 — Thorough Field-by-Field Audit

A complete audit was conducted mapping the entire extraction-to-data-store pipeline for Flow 5: what the agent extracts → how Node 4 (Extract Structured Call Responses) transforms it → what gets written to the data store in each outcome path (qualified, rejected, no answer).

This audit uncovered seven issues (A–G), all of which were fixed across versions v85–v90.

