## Changes Made

### Issue A — firstName/lastName corrections never persisted (FIXED in v86)

Node 4 extracted `firstName` and `lastName` (with fallback to the candidate record), but both the Qualified and Rejected DS update nodes had these fields marked `skip: true`. If Riley corrected a name during the call (e.g., the Ashley/Minnie problem), the corrected name never reached the data store.

**Fix:** Un-skipped `firstName` and `lastName` in both Qualified and Rejected update nodes, mapped to `=variables.extractedResponses.firstName` and `=variables.extractedResponses.lastName`.

---

### Issue B — voiceCallSummary always overwritten with empty string (FIXED in v85 + v86)

Both Qualified and Rejected DS update nodes hardcoded `voiceCallSummary: ""`, wiping any summary on every call. Node 4 originally output the field as `callSummary` (name mismatch with DS field `voiceCallSummary`).

**Fix (v85 by user):** Renamed Node 4 output from `callSummary` to `voiceCallSummary`.

**Fix (v86):** Changed both DS update nodes from `""` to `=variables.extractedResponses.voiceCallSummary`. Also fixed the Send Recruiter Notification email body from `{{variables.extractedResponses.callSummary}}` to `{{variables.extractedResponses.voiceCallSummary}}`.

