## Current Flow 5 Execution Chain (v90)

```
1. Filter Riley Outbound Call (BRANCH)
   ├── No Matching Agent (CONDITION) → stops
   └── Matching Agent (CONDITION)
       2. Lookup Candidate Record (DATA_STORE_GET)
          3. Get Call Session ID - API (API)
             4. Extract Structured Call Responses (CODE) → sets extractedResponses
                5. Determine Voice Screening Outcome (CODE) → sets screeningOutcome
                   6. Transcript Extract (CODE) → sets codeResult
                      7. Outcome Branch (BRANCH)
                         ├── Is Qualified → DS Update → Transcript Email → Recruiter Notification
                         ├── Is Rejected → DS Update → Transcript Email → Rejection Email
                         ├── Is No Answer → DS Update
                         └── Is Needs Review → DS Update → Transcript Email → Recruiter Notification (amber)
```

